<title>UK: IBCA rates United Overseas A/B individual.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates United Overseas A/B individual.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency said on Thursday it assigned an individual rating of A/B to United Overseas Bank (UOB).</p>
<p>The rating is the second highest individual rating level awarded by the agency, IBCA said.  </p>
<p>UOB's previously assigned legal rating of 2 is affirmed, IBCA said.</p>
<p>&quot;United Overseas Bank has a very strong financial profile,&quot; IBCA said. &quot;Not only is UOB rated the third most profitable bank in the world by IBCA, it has the highest reported total capital to risk weighted assets ratio in Singapore of 23 percent.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6176</p>
